1562:Through all those days together, winter melted into spring. And then, the competition was here.
1563:In most cases, brewing from a seated position makes it incredibly hard to control the water flow because you lose the stability of your core. That usually risks an uneven extraction.
1564:But just look at Reina Nanami! She's pushed past those limits. Her focus and muscle memory are absolutely incredible, and she is giving us a flawless performance. You do not reach this level of stability without endless, grueling practice!
1565:For her coffee, she chose a high-altitude, sun-dried heirloom variety. These beans are packed with bold, untamed fruit and floral notes, and they are infamously difficult to work with.
1566:However, her precise pulse pouring brought out the bright acidity and delicate florals right from the start. Then she eased off to build more sweetness and body... Beautiful. Absolutely beautiful!
1567:Ladies and gentlemen, please give it up for the winner of our Rising Star Award... Miss Reina Nanami from Éternité! Such a phenomenal young talent, already displaying skill and taste well beyond her years. She is truly destined for greatness!
1568:The audience bursts into applause.
1569:She did it! It may not be the top prize, but this award means more to her than anything.
1570:Me...?
1571:That's right, yes, you! Don't look so surprised! Miss Nanami, would you like to say a few words?
1572:Thank you, everyone... And thank you to all the judges.
1573:Most of all, I want to thank my mom and dad. Even though they aren't here today, they have always been my guiding light...
1574:And finally... there is someone very special to me...
1575:You stayed by my side through my darkest days, and you showed me that as long as I never give up, there's always hope.
1576:So this award is just as much yours as it is mine. Thank you, {var:player_nickname}.
1577:Thank you for saying those things about me on stage.
1578:To be honest... being able to say what I really feel out loud makes me even happier than winning the award.
1579:...come with me to visit my parents?
1580:I want to bring this award to them myself... and tell them everything that I've been holding in my heart all this time.
1581:It's just up ahead.
1582:Alright.
